text ...And just like that, we pass the time together having fun.
text Nagisa's fever begins to rise at the end of January.
text Eventually, she's unable to so much as rise from bed.
text By contrast, the new life inside her stomach seems animated.
text It's as if it can't wait any longer to be born into the world.
music BGM18B.mp3
text It's practically as if...
text Slowly...
text She's passing her own life over to our child...
text That's... what it looks like to me.
text The thing I had always feared is happening before my eyes...
text The powerful currents of time bring with it an unstoppable wave of sadness.
text And caught within it, Nagisa and I are going to be driven apart...
text Nagisa is going to be taken somewhere, and I'll never be able to see her again.
text Even if I reach out...
text ...and try to connect with her, there won't be anything for me to touch...
text There won't be anything to touch me back.
text I don't want that to happen...
text It can't happen...
text I want Nagisa to live...
text And for our child to be born healthy...
text And to keep protecting my entire family...
text I want us to all be happy together...
text It's my dream...
text And my reason for living.
