text They were trying... to cut down the trees...
sound OWH.aac
text @[Akio]
text Even the ones they said they would keep up...
sound OWI.aac
text @[Akio]
text It's not like I had planned to do it.
sound OWJ.aac
text @[Akio]
text My body just moved on its own...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK13C"
