text But then, they decided to make an on-site decision...
sound OWL.aac
text @[Akio]
text Some big shot came out and said they'd keep some trees after all...
sound OWM.aac
text @[Akio]
text Just a few of them... around a corner of the hospital...
sound OWN.aac
text @[Akio]
text That's all that happened...
text @[Tomoya]
text Can I punch you?
