text Nagisa continues to suffer from her high temperature.
text She seems worn out.
text Does she have the strength she needs to keep fighting?
text But when I see Nagisa's weakened face asleep, I can't handle it any longer.
text The waves have come this close...
text Are they already trying to sweep her away...?
text I put strength into my hands as they hold hers.
sound OWR.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun...
text I hear her voice.
text Nagisa's eyes are squinting open.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm? What's the matter, Nagisa...
sound OWS.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm causing trouble for everyone...
text @[Tomoya]
text Of course you're not, silly...
text @[Tomoya]
text You're working harder than all of us... We all know that...
sound OWT.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I wonder about that...
text @[Tomoya]
text So just get some sleep... You're not in pain right now, are you...?
sound OWU.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text No...
sound OWV.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I'd like to talk to you a little longer...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah... Okay. But not for long, okay?
sound OWW.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...
text Nagisa looks up at the ceiling.
text It's as if she's looking toward what's beyond it... To her future.
sound OWX.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text My goal right now is to give birth to this child...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
sound OWY.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text And...
sound OWZ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text To live together with it and you.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Tears begin to well in my eyes.
text It feels like they'll start streaming down my face as soon as I blink.
text Why does such a simple future seem like a dream to me...?
text Such a normal future...
text A commonplace future...
text If only we were more normal...
text If only we were more commonplace...
text Nagisa's path has always been full of obstacles...
text The kinds of happiness that most people consider normal... are so much further away for her...
text ...Distant hopes and dreams.
text To be alive... That's all.
text Before I realize it, Nagisa's eyes are closed.
text Though she's become thin and frail, she seems so peaceful when she sleeps.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa... I'm never gonna stop...
text I never stop holding her hand.
