music BGM18A.mp3
text Nagisa begins to experience severe contractions.
text Sanae-san asks Nagisa something as she wears an expression of agony.
text When she hears her answer, Sanae-san turns to me.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSN21"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSN21.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound OX0.aac
text @[Sanae]
text Tomoya-san, please.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text It's the sign for me to call Yagi-san, the midwife.
text I immediately pick up the phone and leave to get her in the pouring rain.
bgload KURO.jpg 55
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Nagisa is still in pain when I return with Yagi-san.
text All I can do now is let them take care of the rest.
sound OX1.aac
text @[Yagi]
text Could you please put some hot water in the baby bath, Furukawa-san?
text Yagi-san gives the order to the old man.
sound OX2.aac
text @[Yagi]
text Okazaki-san, you come here and support your wife.
text That's exactly what I want to do.
text I go around to the other side of the room and kneel down by Nagisa's side.
text @[Tomoya]
text Um...
text I begin talking to Yagi-san as she hurriedly takes medical instruments out of her bag.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's okay for me to hold her hand, right?
sound OX3.aac
text @[Yagi]
text Yes, of course. Please do.
text Good.
text It's a relief to be able to do that for Nagisa in her greatest moment of hardship.
text Nagisa's hands are clenched tight as she furiously tries to withstand the pain. I take her hand and force it open.
text Then, I press my own into her sweat-drenched palm.
text Once I do, her hand clamps down on mine, as if she frantically needs it.
text Our fingers entwine until they look like a single mass.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa, I'm right here, okay...?
text Nagisa looks at me for a brief moment.
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text She doesn't say anything, but she gives me a strong nod.
text @[Tomoya]
text Do your best...
text @[Tomoya]
text You can't lose here...
text @[Tomoya]
text Give birth to a healthy child...
text @[Tomoya]
text And the three of us can start our new life together...
sound OX4.aac
text @[Yagi]
text We're going to begin.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Please.
text And so Nagisa's delivery begins.
