text Time and time again, she falls unconscious.
text But then the pain wakes her up.
text This cycle keeps repeating itself.
text It's such a terrible sight that I want to cover my eyes...
text It almost looks like she's being mercilessly tortured to death.
text This isn't something where you can simply "give it your best."
text All you can do is sit there helplessly as it happens to you.
text If this keeps going, Nagisa will die...
text Won't she...?
text Please...
text Please, let this be over...!
text I scream out in my heart.
text It keeps going...
text With no end in sight.
text I think it might go forever...
music ~
text I lose all of my senses and find myself in darkness.
text Ah... What could have happened...?
text Was my heart not able to take any more...?
text Or did I just give up hope...?
text Is it all over...?
jump SEEN6801_3_0.scr
